sequenceDiagram
    title Checkout
    participant B as Browser
    participant S as Server
    participant DB as Database
    B->>S: POST /orders
    S->>DB: INSERT order
    DB-->>S: id = 42
    S-->>B: 201 Created
    B-)S: track event (async)
    S->>S: Recalculate totals
    B-xDB: direct access
    S<<->>DB: sync<br>both ways
